id: SCA-061
title: GitHub Actions production environment reference
category: supply-chain
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yml .yaml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: environment
patterns:
  - regex: environment:\s*(production|prod|live|release)\b
    message: Production environment referenced — ensure environment protection rules are configured in GitHub Settings. Without branch protection, any workflow can deploy to production.
fix: Configure environment protection rules in GitHub Settings > Environments. Require reviewers for production deployments. Enable branch protection on main.
